### ================= 3. ROOMS =================

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "type": "STANDARD",
  "pricePerNight": 1200.00,
  "capacity": 2
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 2,
  "roomNumber": "VIP-1",
  "type": "LUXURY",
  "pricePerNight": 3500.00,
  "capacity": 4
}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "type": "STANDARD",
  "pricePerNight": 1350.00,
  "capacity": 2
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/3
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


